<view class="page"><view class="page-masthead"><image class="masthead-icon" src="/assets/icons/express.png"/><view class="masthead-copy"><view class="page-title">创建送上门批次</view><view class="masthead-subtitle">送到门口，每一户都记清</view></view></view><view class="card"><view class="field"><view class="label">送上门门牌清单</view><view class="muted">每行一个门牌，格式：楼栋-单元-门牌</view><textarea class="address-list" value="{{lines}}" bindinput="change" maxlength="20000" placeholder="例如：1号楼-1单元-302"/></view><view class="muted">系统仅把已明确开启“快递默认送上门”的住户放进批次；未授权门牌不会加入。</view><button type="primary" bindtap="create" disabled="{{busy || !lines}}" loading="{{busy}}">校验同意状态并创建</button></view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</view><view wx:if="{{result}}" class="card"><view class="section-title">门牌校验结果</view><view>已加入批次：{{result.eligibleCount}} 户</view><view>因未授权、撤回或无法关联跳过：{{result.skippedCount}} 户</view><view wx:if="{{result.batchId}}">批次编号：{{result.batchId}}</view><navigator wx:if="{{result.batchId}}" class="picker" url="/station/workbench/workbench">查看批次进度 ›</navigator></view></view><privacy-popup/>
